00:03:19.235 --> 00:03:25.668
<v Host>There are two venues, and together they plan to set off about twenty thousand fireworks into the night sky.

00:03:26.268 --> 00:03:28.788
<v Vocab>打ち上げる

00:03:29.187 --> 00:03:32.283
<v Host>It means to set off or launch fireworks.

00:03:32.883 --> 00:03:44.716
<v Slow>隅田川の花火の歴史はとても古く、江戸時代の1733年に始まったと言われています。

00:03:45.515 --> 00:03:54.204
<v Host>The history of the Sumida River fireworks is very old; it is said to have begun in the year seventeen thirty-three, during the Edo period.

